        <mxCell id="c80" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 13.1. Outlined in coral: the fiscal 2026 row of each visual. Outlined in teal: the GrandTotal column, which exceeds SubTotal by the freight and the tax. The two visuals agree on every year&#x27;s SubTotal, and the table&#x27;s FiscalYear comes from InvoiceHeaders, which no relationship joins to the model.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="362" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
